Bitchat
github.com/permissionlesstech/bitchat
The Unlicense (public domain dedication)

The BLE mesh wire protocol is derived from Bitchat: packet header layout,
TTL and hop relay semantics, fragmentation, and the Noise session handshake.
`shared/BitchatKit.swift` implements Bitchat's public message frames so that
nimmesh can interoperate with real Bitchat meshes. See docs/PROTOCOL.md.

